OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fines increased to
OL,4,A#3,000 by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has increased fines for the
OL,7,Fmost serious fly-tipping offences to
OL,8,F#3,000.
OL,10,FThe changes were agreed by St Albans
OL,11,FCity and District Council's Public
OL,12,FRealm Committee at a meeting on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FIn July, the government announced that
OL,16,Flocal authorities could increase these
OL,17,Ffixed penalty notices up to #5,000.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
