OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping fines increased to
OL,4,A#3,000 by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat councillor Edgar Hill,
OL,7,Fthe committee's vice-chairman and lead
OL,8,Fmember for fly-tipping, said: "The
OL,9,Fincrease in fines shows our
OL,10,Fdetermination to crack down on the
OL,11,Fscourge of fly-tipping in both urban
OL,12,Fand rural areas."
